    <!-- CONTENT START --><p><a href="https://www.hklii.hk/en/cases/hkcfa/" target="_blank"><img class="f_right" src="/filemanager/common/images/work_of_the_court/pic1.jpg" alt="Searchable HKLII database of CFA judgments" width="300" height="265" /></a>Click <a href="https://www.hklii.hk/en/cases/hkcfa/" target="_blank">here</a> to be re-directed to the searchable HKLII database of CFA judgments in decided cases.</p>
<p>There is usually a time lag of a few days between the date of handing down of a CFA judgment and its publication on the HKLII website. Accordingly, on a particular date, this page may not contain all of the CFA judgments. You are advised to check the <a href="/en/work/cases/recent/index.html">Recent Judgments</a> page for those judgments that may not yet have been included in the searchable HKLII database.</p>    <!-- CONTENT END -->
